    "abstract": "Parts figure for the auxiliary power unit mount assembly, showing the heat shield in both standards, the forward mount link, the standoffs and the shroud at the link position.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the auxiliary power unit mount assembly in the tail cone compartment, with the heat shield, the forward mount link and the shroud.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the compartment looking aft with the shield in place; sheet 2 shows the shield removed. Items 10 and 10A are the shield standards; the stiffened shield at item 10 needs the two standoffs at item 30 and a different fastener spacing at the forward edge. The shouldered forward link at item 20 must be fitted whenever the stiffened shield is fitted, and the two are ordered together."
    },
