    "abstract": "Parts figure for the auxiliary power unit mount assembly, showing the heat shield in both standards, the forward mount link, the standoffs and the shroud at the link position.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the auxiliary power unit mount assembly in the tail cone compartment, with the heat shield, the forward mount link and the shroud.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the compartment looking aft with the shield in place; sheet 2 shows the shield removed. Items 10 and 10A are the shield standards; the stiffened shield at item 10 needs the two standoffs at item 30 and a different fastener spacing at the forward edge. The shouldered forward link at item 20 must be fitted whenever the stiffened shield is fitted, and the two are ordered together. Review note: this figure was checked against the cancellation of the mount heat shield survey bulletin and needs no change from it. The shield and the link were already split by effectivity at items 10, 10A and 20 when that bulletin was live, the survey never introduced or consumed a part, and its withdrawal leaves nothing in the parts content to correct. The check is recorded here so that the figure is not reopened for the same reason."
    },
